@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title CP — hypothesis support or rejection
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Specific suspected mechanism / possible effect\nState competing explanation and affected case" as Hypothesis
rectangle "Define actual evidence and interpretation\nRelevant case + policy + measure; no invented target/sample size" as Method
rectangle "Inspect permitted actual case / record limits\nDistinguish genuine rework from intended difference" as Observe
rectangle "Support, reject or narrow only what evidence warrants\nUnknown remains unknown; no automatic root-cause conclusion" as Result #DFF1EA
Hypothesis --> Method
Method --> Observe : later separately performed observation
Observe --> Result
Result ..> Hypothesis : refine if another explanation fits
note bottom of Result
Current CP-H rows are untested, not confirmed user/product bottlenecks.
Documentation facts CP-F have a different evidence scope.
end note

legend bottom
Source-based analysis; target behavior and hypotheses are not observed current task sequences.
No interview, business-task timing, live product/reference inspection or improvement test performed.
endlegend
@enduml
